  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 1680,
      "text": "说让我补录一段啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 1680,
      "end_ms": 6040,
      "text": "就是说就是说哲人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 6040,
      "end_ms": 12559,
      "text": "哲学家或者我们行动者可以立刻跳出这种什么信任信任同的僵局啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 12559,
      "end_ms": 13699,
      "text": "这东西很蠢的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 13699,
      "end_ms": 17280,
      "text": "因为你要意识到你撤回到先验主体性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 17500,
      "end_ms": 22120,
      "text": "一方面你是撤回到一个极限的一个虚无了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 22120,
      "end_ms": 23560,
      "text": "所以一切都是外在的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 23560,
      "end_ms": 27740,
      "text": "同时先验框架架设这整个世界"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 27740,
      "end_ms": 29720,
      "text": "所以整个世界都是一个内在的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 29720,
      "end_ms": 31640,
      "text": "它既是内在也是外在的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 31640,
      "end_ms": 34280,
      "text": "所以这快感发生学的机制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 34280,
      "end_ms": 35540,
      "text": "它既内在右外的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 35540,
      "end_ms": 36830,
      "text": "它是超性化的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 36830,
      "end_ms": 37760,
      "text": "你是个行动者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 37760,
      "end_ms": 41390,
      "text": "你根本不会在意你到底是自我认同是个什么性别"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 41390,
      "end_ms": 44930,
      "text": "我靠你的什么什么快感方式一定得是内在的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 44930,
      "end_ms": 46010,
      "text": "或者一定得是我在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 46010,
      "end_ms": 46370,
      "text": "you"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 46370,
      "end_ms": 48180,
      "text": "you will never care about it"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 48180,
      "end_ms": 49140,
      "text": "你根本不会在乎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 49140,
      "end_ms": 51090,
      "text": "如果never trouble"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 51090,
      "end_ms": 52059,
      "text": "trouble"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 52340,
      "end_ms": 54080,
      "text": "don't never trouble"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 54080,
      "end_ms": 55699,
      "text": "根本不会在乎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 55820,
      "end_ms": 57020,
      "text": "不是你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 57020,
      "end_ms": 60470,
      "text": "你这不是让你得到一个在性享乐上的自由"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 60470,
      "end_ms": 63140,
      "text": "他是让你根本不在乎这个事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 63140,
      "end_ms": 64700,
      "text": "你们为什么会在乎这种事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 64700,
      "end_ms": 67570,
      "text": "你还是想要玩这个恶毒的游戏吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 67570,
      "end_ms": 71170,
      "text": "你们这还你们这些孩童是因为压抑太久了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 71170,
      "end_ms": 74380,
      "text": "就就想拼命的玩这种恶毒的游戏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 74780,
      "end_ms": 78200,
      "text": "这是一个很很恶毒的前反思的愚蠢的游戏啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 78200,
      "end_ms": 80539,
      "text": "难道你就玩玩这种游戏玩一辈子吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 81580,
      "end_ms": 83790,
      "text": "we just want to escape this"
